[Bb]in/[Dd]ebug/
[Bb]in/[Rr]elease/
[Bb]in/[Xx]64/
[Bb]in/[Xx]86/
[Bb]in/[Aa]ny[Cc]PU/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
